<topic template="Default" modified="2025-05-13T15:06:56.722-04:00" lasteditedby="rbwinst" xmlns:xsi="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema-instance" xsi:noNamespaceSchemaLocation="../helpproject.xsd">
  <title translate="true">ATES Defining Aquifer properties</title>
  <body>
    <header>
      <para styleclass="Heading1"><text styleclass="Heading1" translate="true">ATES Defining Aquifer properties</text></para>
    </header>
    <para styleclass="Normal"><text styleclass="Normal" translate="true">Most of the aquifer properties are the same for all three units. However, the middle unit has different properties. We will specify default values for all the data sets and then use a rectangular object to define the properties of the middle unit.</text></para>
    <para styleclass="Normal"><text styleclass="Normal" translate="true">Select &quot;Data|Edit Data Sets&quot; and change the following default formulas.</text></para>
    <para styleclass="Normal"><table styleclass="Default" rowcount="17" colcount="2" style="border-width:2px; border-spacing:0px; border-collapse:collapse; cell-border-width:1px; border-color:#000000; border-style:solid;">
      <tr style="vertical-align:top">
        <td>
          <para styleclass="Table Header"><text styleclass="Table Header" translate="true">Name</text></para>
        </td>
        <td>
          <para styleclass="Table Header"><text styleclass="Table Header" translate="true">Default Formula</text></para>
        </td>
      </tr>
      <tr style="vertical-align:top">
        <td>
          <para styleclass="Table Cell"><text styleclass="Table Cell" translate="true">Density_Solid_Temperature</text></para>
        </td>
        <td>
          <para styleclass="Table Cell"><text styleclass="Table Cell" translate="true">2500</text></para>
        </td>
      </tr>
      <tr style="vertical-align:top">
        <td>
          <para styleclass="Table Cell"><text styleclass="Table Cell" translate="true">Heat_Capacity_Solid_Temperature</text></para>
        </td>
        <td>
          <para styleclass="Table Cell"><text styleclass="Table Cell" translate="true">850</text></para>
        </td>
      </tr>
      <tr style="vertical-align:top">
        <td>
          <para styleclass="Table Cell"><text styleclass="Table Cell" translate="true">Porosity_Temperature</text></para>
        </td>
        <td>
          <para styleclass="Table Cell"><text styleclass="Table Cell" translate="true">0.01</text></para>
        </td>
      </tr>
      <tr style="vertical-align:top">
        <td>
          <para styleclass="Table Cell"><text styleclass="Table Cell" translate="true">Thermal_Conductivity_Fluid_Temperature</text></para>
        </td>
        <td>
          <para styleclass="Table Cell"><text styleclass="Table Cell" translate="true">0.58</text></para>
        </td>
      </tr>
      <tr style="vertical-align:top">
        <td>
          <para styleclass="Table Cell"><text styleclass="Table Cell" translate="true">Thermal_Conductivity_Solid_Temperature</text></para>
        </td>
        <td>
          <para styleclass="Table Cell"><text styleclass="Table Cell" translate="true">120960</text></para>
        </td>
      </tr>
      <tr style="vertical-align:top">
        <td>
          <para styleclass="Table Cell"><text styleclass="Table Cell" translate="true">Horizontal_Transverse_Dispersivity_Horizontal_Flow_Temperature</text></para>
        </td>
        <td>
          <para styleclass="Table Cell"><text styleclass="Table Cell" translate="true">0.01</text></para>
        </td>
      </tr>
      <tr style="vertical-align:top">
        <td>
          <para styleclass="Table Cell"><text styleclass="Table Cell" translate="true">Longitudinal_Dispersivity_Horizontal_Flow_Temperature</text></para>
        </td>
        <td>
          <para styleclass="Table Cell"><text styleclass="Table Cell" translate="true">0.01</text></para>
        </td>
      </tr>
      <tr style="vertical-align:top">
        <td>
          <para styleclass="Table Cell"><text styleclass="Table Cell" translate="true">Longitudinal_Dispersivity_Vertical_Flow_Temperature</text></para>
        </td>
        <td>
          <para styleclass="Table Cell"><text styleclass="Table Cell" translate="true">0.1</text></para>
        </td>
      </tr>
      <tr style="vertical-align:top">
        <td>
          <para styleclass="Table Cell"><text styleclass="Table Cell" translate="true">Vertical_Transverse_Dispersivity_Horizontal_Flow_Temperature</text></para>
        </td>
        <td>
          <para styleclass="Table Cell"><text styleclass="Table Cell" translate="true">0.01</text></para>
        </td>
      </tr>
      <tr style="vertical-align:top">
        <td>
          <para styleclass="Table Cell"><text styleclass="Table Cell" translate="true">Vertical_Transverse_Dispersivity_Temperature</text></para>
        </td>
        <td>
          <para styleclass="Table Cell"><text styleclass="Table Cell" translate="true">0.01</text></para>
        </td>
      </tr>
      <tr style="vertical-align:top">
        <td>
          <para styleclass="Table Cell"><text styleclass="Table Cell" translate="true">Kx</text></para>
        </td>
        <td>
          <para styleclass="Table Cell"><text styleclass="Table Cell" translate="true">0.000864</text></para>
        </td>
      </tr>
      <tr style="vertical-align:top">
        <td>
          <para styleclass="Table Cell"><text styleclass="Table Cell" translate="true">Kz</text></para>
        </td>
        <td>
          <para styleclass="Table Cell"><text styleclass="Table Cell" translate="true">Kx</text></para>
        </td>
      </tr>
      <tr style="vertical-align:top">
        <td>
          <para styleclass="Table Cell"><text styleclass="Table Cell" translate="true">Modflow_Initial_Head</text></para>
        </td>
        <td>
          <para styleclass="Table Cell"><text styleclass="Table Cell" translate="true">1000</text></para>
        </td>
      </tr>
      <tr style="vertical-align:top">
        <td>
          <para styleclass="Table Cell"><text styleclass="Table Cell" translate="true">Specific_Storage</text></para>
        </td>
        <td>
          <para styleclass="Table Cell"><text styleclass="Table Cell" translate="true">0.001</text></para>
        </td>
      </tr>
      <tr style="vertical-align:top">
        <td>
          <para styleclass="Table Cell"><text styleclass="Table Cell" translate="true">Specific_Yield</text></para>
        </td>
        <td>
          <para styleclass="Table Cell"><text styleclass="Table Cell" translate="true">0.1</text></para>
        </td>
      </tr>
      <tr style="vertical-align:top">
        <td>
          <para styleclass="Table Cell"><text styleclass="Table Cell" translate="true">Initial_Temperature</text></para>
        </td>
        <td>
          <para styleclass="Table Cell"><text styleclass="Table Cell" translate="true">50</text></para>
        </td>
      </tr>
    </table></para>
    <para styleclass="Normal"><image src="ATES_Default_Properties.png" imagestyleclass="Default" scale="-60.00%" styleclass="Image Caption" figurelistinclude="0"><title translate="true">Screen capture of the Edit Data Sets dialog box illustating the data sets that need to be edited</title><caption translate="true"><![CDATA[Screen capture of the Edit Data Sets dialog box illustating the data sets that need to be edited]]></caption></image></para>
    <para styleclass="Normal"><text styleclass="Normal" translate="true">Now create a rectangle object to define the properties of the middle unit. It should extend from (0,35) to (135, 15). Its vertices should be the following.</text></para>
    <para styleclass="Code Example"><text styleclass="Code Example" translate="true">0,</text><tab /><text styleclass="Code Example" translate="true">35</text><br/><text styleclass="Code Example" translate="true">135,</text><tab /><text styleclass="Code Example" translate="true">35</text><br/><text styleclass="Code Example" translate="true">135,</text><tab /><text styleclass="Code Example" translate="true">15</text><br/><text styleclass="Code Example" translate="true">0,</text><tab /><text styleclass="Code Example" translate="true">15</text><br/><text styleclass="Code Example" translate="true">0,</text><tab /><text styleclass="Code Example" translate="true">35</text></para>
    <para styleclass="Normal"><text styleclass="Normal" translate="true">Use the object to set the following properties.</text></para>
    <para styleclass="Normal"><table styleclass="Default" rowcount="6" colcount="2" style="border-width:2px; border-spacing:0px; border-collapse:collapse; cell-border-width:1px; border-color:#000000; border-style:solid;">
      <tr style="vertical-align:top">
        <td style="width:273px;">
          <para styleclass="Table Header"><text styleclass="Table Header" translate="true">Name</text></para>
        </td>
        <td style="width:271px;">
          <para styleclass="Table Header"><text styleclass="Table Header" translate="true">Default Formula</text></para>
        </td>
      </tr>
      <tr style="vertical-align:top">
        <td style="width:273px;">
          <para styleclass="Table Cell"><text styleclass="Table Cell" translate="true">Heat_Capacity_Solid_Temperature</text></para>
        </td>
        <td style="width:271px;">
          <para styleclass="Table Cell"><text styleclass="Table Cell" translate="true">1100</text></para>
        </td>
      </tr>
      <tr style="vertical-align:top">
        <td style="width:273px;">
          <para styleclass="Table Cell"><text styleclass="Table Cell" translate="true">Porosity_Temperature</text></para>
        </td>
        <td style="width:271px;">
          <para styleclass="Table Cell"><text styleclass="Table Cell" translate="true">0.1</text></para>
        </td>
      </tr>
      <tr style="vertical-align:top">
        <td style="width:273px;">
          <para styleclass="Table Cell"><text styleclass="Table Cell" translate="true">Thermal_Conductivity_Solid_Temperature</text></para>
        </td>
        <td style="width:271px;">
          <para styleclass="Table Cell"><text styleclass="Table Cell" translate="true">259200</text></para>
        </td>
      </tr>
      <tr style="vertical-align:top">
        <td style="width:273px;">
          <para styleclass="Table Cell"><text styleclass="Table Cell" translate="true">Kx</text></para>
        </td>
        <td style="width:271px;">
          <para styleclass="Table Cell"><text styleclass="Table Cell" translate="true">8.64</text></para>
        </td>
      </tr>
      <tr style="vertical-align:top">
        <td style="width:273px;">
          <para styleclass="Table Cell"><text styleclass="Table Cell" translate="true">Specific_Yield</text></para>
        </td>
        <td style="width:271px;">
          <para styleclass="Table Cell"><text styleclass="Table Cell" translate="true">0.01</text></para>
        </td>
      </tr>
    </table></para>
    <para styleclass="Normal"><image src="ATES_Zone1_Properties.png" imagestyleclass="Default" scale="-70.00%" styleclass="Image Caption" figurelistinclude="0"><title translate="true">Screen capture illustrating setting the properties of zone 1 with an object</title><caption translate="true"><![CDATA[Screen capture illustrating setting the properties of zone 1 with an object]]></caption></image></para>
  </body>
</topic>
